<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-02-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Riina Maigre"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Tarmo Robal"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Connector (Bridge) module that only defines object properties between modules. The connector contains only object properties that have domain and range specified in different modules. \n\n--\nTHIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. \nAll liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-09-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. \nIn case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Connector module of the EU regulatory compliant Digital Product Passport Core Ontology (EU DPP CO) proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "con" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The CON module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EU DPP CORE CON"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/CON> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0.7" .
