<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasNotifiedBody> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the conformity assessment body notified in accordance with ESPR Chapter IX\t\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasNotifiedBody> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has notified body"@en .
