<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasResponsibleManufacturer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2008/768(1)/oj#anx_I" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasResponsibleManufacturer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
