<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isIssuedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the natural or legal person issuing the Declaration of Conformity; ESPR Annex V, paragraph 3 requirement: \"This declaration of conformity is issued under the sole responsibility of the manufacturer:\"\n\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
