<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isNotifiedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the conformity assessment activities, the conformity assessment module or modules and product or products concerned and the relevant attestation of competence\t\n\nUnionHarmonisationLegislation is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isNotifiedFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is notified for"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSignedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
