<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj/#anx_%C2%A0V" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies conformity assess procedure/cerfication scheme performed by the notified body.\n\n\nConformityAssessmentModule is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAssessmentAccordingTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed assessment according to"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Facility> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event to the facility where the event was performed or operationally occurred. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR/Facility and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nProductEvent is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nFacility is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed at"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/bizLocation> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/readPoint> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a product event to the actor that performed, carried out, or was operationally responsible for the event. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nProductEvent is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performed by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#performedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ActorRoleAssignment> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/eudpp#DPPEventRecord> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a DPP event record to the actor that created the technical record of the logged DPP-side event. This is a cross-module relation between EVENT and ACTOR and is therefore managed in the Connector/mapping layer.\n\nDPPEventRecord is modelled in the EU DPP CO EVENT module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#recordedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recorded by"@en .
